        "html_DYjkRi": {
          "type": "html",
          "settings": {
            "code": "<style>\n    @media (min-width:768px) {\n        .faq-container {\n            padding: 20px;\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n            gap: 20px;\n        }\n\n        .faqdiv {\n            width: 50%;\n        }\n    }\n\n    .faq-item {\n        margin-bottom: 20px;\n    }\n\n    .faq-question {\n        width: 100%;\n        background-color: #F5F7FF;\n        border: none;\n        padding: 15px;\n        text-align: left;\n        cursor: pointer;\n        border-radius: 4px;\n        transition: background-color 0.3s;\n        display: flex;\n        justify-content: space-between;\n        align-items: center;\n        color: #000;\n    }\n\n    .faq-question h4 {\n        margin: 0;\n        font-size: 16px;\n        font-weight: 600;\n        line-height: 1.5;\n        width: calc(100% - 30px);\n    }\n\n    .faq-question:hover {\n        background-color: #e1e1e1;\n    }\n\n    .faq-question.active {\n        background-color: #2a6ab2;\n        color: #fff;\n        border-radius: 4px 4px 0 0;\n    }\n\n    .faq-question.active h4 {\n        color: #fff;\n    }\n\n    .faq-answer {\n        max-height: 0;\n        opacity: 0;\n        overflow: hidden;\n        padding: 0 15px;\n        background-color: #2a6ab2;\n        border-radius: 0 0 4px 4px;\n        font-size: 14px;\n        line-height: 1.8;\n        color: #fff;\n        transition: max-height 0.5s ease, opacity 0.5s ease, padding 0.5s ease;\n    }\n\n    .faq-answer.open {\n        max-height: 500px;\n        opacity: 1;\n        padding: 15px;\n        border-top: 1px solid #DBE2FF;\n    }\n\n    .faq-icon {\n        width: 20px;\n        height: 20px;\n        margin-left: 10px;\n        flex-shrink: 0;\n    }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"faq-container\">\n\n    <!-- Left Column -->\n    <div class=\"faqdiv\">\n\n        <div class=\"faq-item\">\n            <button class=\"faq-question\">\n                <h4>Is a water softener without salt better than a traditional salt-based softener?</h4>\n\n                <span>\n                    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0592/6508/9638/files/Frame_49.png?v=1720679877\" class=\"faq-icon open-icon\" alt=\"Open Icon\">\n\n                    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0592/6508/9638/files/4444.png?v=1720679877\" class=\"faq-icon close-icon\" style=\"display:none;\" alt=\"Close Icon\">\n                </span>\n            </button>\n\n            <div class=\"faq-answer\">\nIt depends on your needs. A <strong>water softener without salt </strong>is ideal for homeowners who want to reduce scale buildup without dealing with salt refills, regeneration cycles, or water wastage. It also retains beneficial minerals in the water.\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"faq-item\">\n            <button class=\"faq-question\">\n                <h4>Does a salt free water softener remove calcium and magnesium from water?</h4>\n\n                <span>\n                    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0592/6508/9638/files/Frame_49.png?v=1720679877\" class=\"faq-icon open-icon\" alt=\"Open Icon\">\n\n                    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0592/6508/9638/files/4444.png?v=1720679877\" class=\"faq-icon close-icon\" style=\"display:none;\" alt=\"Close Icon\">\n                </span>\n            </button>\n\n            <div class=\"faq-answer\">\n         No. A salt free water softener does not remove calcium or magnesium. Instead, it conditions these minerals so they are less likely to stick to surfaces and create scale buildup.\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"faq-item\">\n            <button class=\"faq-question\">\n                <h4>Can I install a water softener without salt in my overhead water tank?</h4>\n\n                <span>\n                    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0592/6508/9638/files/Frame_49.png?v=1720679877\" class=\"faq-icon open-icon\" alt=\"Open Icon\">\n\n                    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0592/6508/9638/files/4444.png?v=1720679877\" class=\"faq-icon close-icon\" style=\"display:none;\" alt=\"Close Icon\">\n                </span>\n            </button>\n\n            <div class=\"faq-answer\">\nYes. Many <strong>water softener without salt</strong> systems, including overhead tank solutions, are designed for easy installation inside the water storage tank without requiring major plumbing modifications.\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Right Column -->\n    <div class=\"faqdiv\">\n\n        <div class=\"faq-item\">\n            <button class=\"faq-question\">\n                <h4>Do salt free water softeners require electricity?</h4>\n\n                <span>\n                    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0592/6508/9638/files/Frame_49.png?v=1720679877\" class=\"faq-icon open-icon\" alt=\"Open Icon\">\n\n                    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0592/6508/9638/files/4444.png?v=1720679877\" class=\"faq-icon close-icon\" style=\"display:none;\" alt=\"Close Icon\">\n                </span>\n            </button>\n\n            <div class=\"faq-answer\">\nMost modern <strong>saltless water softener</strong> systems operate without electricity, making them energy-efficient and suitable for continuous use.\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"faq-item\">\n            <button class=\"faq-question\">\n                <h4>Is maintenance required for a salt free water softener?</h4>\n\n                <span>\n                    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0592/6508/9638/files/Frame_49.png?v=1720679877\" class=\"faq-icon open-icon\" alt=\"Open Icon\">\n\n                    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0592/6508/9638/files/4444.png?v=1720679877\" class=\"faq-icon close-icon\" style=\"display:none;\" alt=\"Close Icon\">\n                </span>\n            </button>\n\n            <div class=\"faq-answer\">\nOne of the biggest advantages of the Scale-O salt free water softener is its low-maintenance design. Unlike traditional systems, there are no salt refills or regeneration cycles, significantly reducing upkeep.\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"faq-item\">\n            <button class=\"faq-question\">\n                <h4>Will a salt free water softener improve the lifespan of appliances?</h4>\n\n                <span>\n                    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0592/6508/9638/files/Frame_49.png?v=1720679877\" class=\"faq-icon open-icon\" alt=\"Open Icon\">\n\n                    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0592/6508/9638/files/4444.png?v=1720679877\" class=\"faq-icon close-icon\" style=\"display:none;\" alt=\"Close Icon\">\n                </span>\n            </button>\n\n            <div class=\"faq-answer\">\nYes. By reducing scale formation, a salt free water softener helps protect geysers, washing machines, dishwashers, water heaters, pipelines and other appliances, which can improve their efficiency and longevity.\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"faq-item\">\n            <button class=\"faq-question\">\n                <h4>Does a saltless water softener change the taste of water?</h4>\n\n                <span>\n                    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0592/6508/9638/files/Frame_49.png?v=1720679877\" class=\"faq-icon open-icon\" alt=\"Open Icon\">\n\n                    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0592/6508/9638/files/4444.png?v=1720679877\" class=\"faq-icon close-icon\" style=\"display:none;\" alt=\"Close Icon\">\n                </span>\n            </button>\n\n            <div class=\"faq-answer\">\nNo. Since a <strong>saltless water softener</strong> does not add sodium or remove natural minerals, it generally does not alter the taste of the water.\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n</div>\n\n<script>\n    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function () {\n\n        const questions = document.querySelectorAll('.faq-question');\n\n        questions.forEach(question => {\n\n            question.addEventListener('click', function () {\n\n                const answer = this.nextElementSibling;\n                const isOpen = answer.classList.contains('open');\n\n                // Close all FAQ items\n                document.querySelectorAll('.faq-answer').forEach(item => {\n                    item.classList.remove('open');\n                });\n\n                document.querySelectorAll('.faq-question').forEach(item => {\n                    item.classList.remove('active');\n                });\n\n                document.querySelectorAll('.open-icon').forEach(icon => {\n                    icon.style.display = 'inline-block';\n                });\n\n                document.querySelectorAll('.close-icon').forEach(icon => {\n                    icon.style.display = 'none';\n                });\n\n                // Open current FAQ item\n                if (!isOpen) {\n                    answer.classList.add('open');\n                    this.classList.add('active');\n\n                    this.querySelector('.open-icon').style.display = 'none';\n                    this.querySelector('.close-icon').style.display = 'inline-block';\n                }\n\n            });\n\n        });\n\n    });\n</script>",
            "width": "100%",
            "block_custom_class": "",
            "animations": "inherit"
          }
        }
      },
